{"id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-KF.md","title":"完整编码量化的 Kripke–Feferman 理论","display":"df-KF — 完整编码量化的 Kripke–Feferman 理论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-KF","aliases":["91-df-KF","91-df-kripke-feferman"],"display":"df-KF — 完整编码量化的 Kripke–Feferman 理论","depends_on":["[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","[[91-df-induction-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-KF"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-KF</span><span>91-df-kripke-feferman</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-KF — 完整编码量化的 Kripke–Feferman 理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 为经典一阶演绎闭包。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\)</span> 包含全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 归纳，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(a)\\equiv\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(a)\">\\(D(a)\\equiv\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(a)\\)</span>；闭项量词及所有总编码函数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N(a)\\coloneqq T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\">\\(N(a)\\coloneqq T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\)</span> 只是当前对象公式的缩写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{KF}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{KF}}\\)</span> 为下列十三个句子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}KF}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall s\\forall t\\quad&amp;T(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t);\\\\\n\\forall s\\forall t\\quad&amp;N(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)\\ne\\operatorname{val}(t);\\\\\n\\forall a\\quad&amp;D(a)\\to[T(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{neg}(a)))\\leftrightarrow T(a)];\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\to[T(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T(a)\\land T(b))];\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\to[N(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(N(a)\\lor N(b))];\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\to[T(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T(a)\\lor T(b))];\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\to[N(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(N(a)\\land N(b))];\\\\\n\\forall v\\forall a\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\to[T(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\forall t\\,T(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))];\\\\\n\\forall v\\forall a\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\to[N(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\exists t\\,N(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))];\\\\\n\\forall v\\forall a\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\to[T(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\exists t\\,T(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))];\\\\\n\\forall v\\forall a\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\to[N(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\forall t\\,N(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))];\\\\\n\\forall t\\quad&amp;T(\\operatorname{tr}(t))\\leftrightarrow T(\\operatorname{val}(t));\\\\\n\\forall t\\quad&amp;N(\\operatorname{tr}(t))\\leftrightarrow[N(\\operatorname{val}(t))\\lor\\neg D(\\operatorname{val}(t))].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}KF}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall s\\forall t\\quad&amp;T(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t);\\\\\n\\forall s\\forall t\\quad&amp;N(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)\\ne\\operatorname{val}(t);\\\\\n\\forall a\\quad&amp;D(a)\\to[T(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{neg}(a)))\\leftrightarrow T(a)];\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\to[T(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T(a)\\land T(b))];\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\to[N(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(N(a)\\lor N(b))];\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\to[T(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T(a)\\lor T(b))];\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\to[N(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(N(a)\\land N(b))];\\\\\n\\forall v\\forall a\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\to[T(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\forall t\\,T(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))];\\\\\n\\forall v\\forall a\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\to[N(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\exists t\\,N(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))];\\\\\n\\forall v\\forall a\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\to[T(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\exists t\\,T(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))];\\\\\n\\forall v\\forall a\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\to[N(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\forall t\\,N(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))];\\\\\n\\forall t\\quad&amp;T(\\operatorname{tr}(t))\\leftrightarrow T(\\operatorname{val}(t));\\\\\n\\forall t\\quad&amp;N(\\operatorname{tr}(t))\\leftrightarrow[N(\\operatorname{val}(t))\\lor\\neg D(\\operatorname{val}(t))].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{KF}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KF}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{KF}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>公理使用经典背景逻辑，内部否定是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N(a)\">\\(N(a)\\)</span> 而不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(a)\">\\(\\neg T(a)\\)</span>。旧版缺少双重否定子句，且只覆盖命名标准句、遗漏非句子项的负真理分支，不能刻画原书 KF。\nKF 不含 CONS；其标准闭合模型可对应含真值过剩的固定点。在标准模型上加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a(T(a)\\to D(a))\">\\(\\forall a(T(a)\\to D(a))\\)</span> 后，Theorem 15.15 精确刻画所有 Kripke 真理集；不只刻画极小固定点。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 15.2，印刷页 186–187，PDF 页 197–198；Theorem 15.15，印刷页 197，PDF 页 208。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":